            "name": "Factset Create a chat request for a given natural language query.",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns a chat ID for polling the response to a natural language query for financial data.\n\n  This endpoint is an interface for initializing a request for an answer from FactSet Mercury, our large language model for surfacing FactSet datasets through conversational natural language queries. Use the `/create` endpoint to start generating responses for one-off questions. Responses contain a chat ID and status for the chat process.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
